NCT05545592.eligibility_criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

1. Female;
2. Aged between 20 and 40 years old;
3. Frozen thawed embryo transfer is proposed, and the type of transferred embryo is blastocyst (the number of transferred embryos is 1);
